   b. publish, distribute, upload, host or make available the Software or
      any modified version of it, built or as source, to anyone else: in
      particular on game portals, app stores, websites, file-sharing
      services or as part of another game or product;
   c. use the Software, or substantial parts of its source code, its game
      design, its levels or its assets, to build or publish a game, product
      or service that competes with Mega Droid, including re-skins, clones,
