      it off as yours, misrepresents its origin, or could harm the
      reputation, income or business opportunities of its creator;
   e. use the names "Mega Droid", "Flux", "Pip", "Atlas", "Dr. Vex", the
      Core Masters' names, the game's logo or its characters for anything
      other than referring to the original game;
   f. remove or change this license or any copyright notice;
   g. use the Software, its assets or its source code to train, fine-tune or
      evaluate machine-learning models.

